# name hex description
POST_BOOT 00 boot
POST_UART_INIT_DONE 01 uart init done
POST_BEFORE_CAR 0E before car

POST_CAR_DONE 10 car done
POST_ENTER_C 11 enter to C
POST_LEAVE_CAR 12 leave CAR / switch to DRAM stack
POST_DRAM_STACK 13 running on DRAM stack
POST_BIOS_ENTRY 14 entered BIOS payload

POST_PCI_PROBE_START E7 pci probe start
POST_SMBUS_PROBE_START E8 smbus probe start
POST_DRAM_INIT_START E9 dram init start
POST_DRAM_TEST_PASS EA dram test pass

POST_DRAM_UNSUPPORTED F0 unsupported dram configuration
POST_DRAM_INIT_FAIL F1 dram init failed
POST_DRAM_TEST_FAIL F2 dram test failed
POST_BIST_FAIL FF bist fail
